WEBVTT

00:05:59.021 --> 00:06:01.273
you don't react with anger or hate.

00:06:01.315 --> 00:06:04.235
You just remain calm
and look at them and say --

00:06:04.276 --> 00:06:06.987
and you can do this online
and in person, too --

00:06:07.863 --> 00:06:10.825
but you just look at them calmly,
and you tell them,

00:06:11.617 --> 00:06:13.953
"That's an interesting viewpoint.

00:06:13.953 --> 00:06:15.204
Tell me more."

00:06:16.664 --> 00:06:20.459
With that, you've invited them
into a conversation

00:06:20.501 --> 00:06:21.710
instead of a fight.

00:06:22.503 --> 00:06:28.801
And you don't have to agree with somebody
to offer them loving attention.

00:06:29.969 --> 00:06:32.638
All you're admitting at that moment